# Dwarf Therapist hand-off flag -- DISABLED, it does not work on this build.
#
# `df.global.game` does not exist in DF 0.47 (it is a v50 structure), so this
# line raised `Cannot read field global.game: not found` on every single startup
# and set nothing. It came in with the vendored Dwarf Therapist config.
#
# Dwarf Therapist on 0.47 attaches to the process directly and needs no flag set
# from inside DFHack, so there is nothing to replace it with. Left here, commented,
# so the intent is on record rather than silently dropped.
#
#:lua df.global.game.external_flag = 1
